{
  "//": [
    "Widget 级别配置示例。",
    "",
    "用法：复制本文件到",
    "  <personal_space.root_path>/<ps_id>/widgets/<widget_id>/widget.config.json",
    "例：",
    "  ~/pyclaego/personal_spaces/alice/widgets/w_chat_default/widget.config.json",
    "",
    "层级（deep_merge，从低到高）：",
    "  global YAML  ←  personal_space.config.json  ←  widget_class.defaults  ←  widget.config.json",
    "",
    "本文件优先级最高，会覆盖前三层中的同名字段。",
    "所有键都是可选的；只写你想为该 widget 单独定制的部分。"
  ],

  "agent": {
    "//": "为该 widget 单独指定 Agent 策略",
    "type": "pipeline",
    "llm": "openai_gpt5"
  },

  "context": {
    "//": "为该 widget 单独指定 Context 策略",
    "type": "window_v3",
    "window": {
      "keep_groups": 3
    }
  },

  "ps_metadata": {
    "//": "Widget 级元数据覆盖",
    "project_root": "/tmp/scratch"
  }
}
